<title>CHILE: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CHILEAN ATP TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results Thursday from the</p>
<p>Hellmann's Cup ATP tournament (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1- Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Mariano Zabaleta (Argentina) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>7-Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain) 6-1 3-6</p>
<p>3-6</p>
<p>Oliver Gross (Germany) beat Luis Adrian Morejon (Ecuador) 1-6</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
